[{"title":"虞美人  惜春","author":"李雯","text":"蜂黄蝶粉依然在，无奈春风改。\n小窗微切玉玲珑，千里行尘不惜牡丹红。\n西陵松柏知何处，目断金椎路。\n无端花絮上帘钩，飞下一天春恨满皇州。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5897,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"踏莎行  春夜写怀","author":"李雯","text":"绿染荒丘，红愁古戍，好春断送斜阳路。\n天边遗下碧桃花，人间竞买珊瑚树。\n芍药香消，青梅酸破，这回难写风流句。\n灯前尚爱墨花浮，明知宿业相缠处。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5898,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"风流子 送春","author":"李雯","text":"谁教春去也？\n人间恨，何处问斜阳？\n见花褪残红，莺捎浓绿，思量往事，尘海茫茫。\n芳心谢，锦梭停旧织，麝月懒新妆。\n杜宇数声，觉馀惊梦；碧栏三尺，空倚愁肠。\n东君抛人易，回头处，犹是昔日池塘。\n留下长杨紫陌，付与谁行？\n想折柳声中，吹来不尽；落花影里，舞去还香。\n难把一樽轻送，多少暄凉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5899,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"一斛珠  寓言","author":"李雯","text":"垂阳如幕，看花每恨东风恶。\n舞衣虽在薇香薄。\n撩乱云鬟，何处安金雀。\n天上柳绵吹又落，玉颜已破情如昨。\n学时剩有相思约。\n今日相思，人倚栏干角。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5900,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小重山  写怀","author":"李雯","text":"上苑苔侵临砌花。\n杏梁新燕子、属谁家。\n晓风吹破碧窗纱。\n丁香结，憔悴过韶华。\n有梦寄天涯。\n海棠开遍了、朋痕斜。\n三春清泪落鸣笳。\n愁如海，不著踏青鞋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5901,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"锦帐春  遣意","author":"李雯","text":"好酒难胜，游丝易断，片晌沉吟千遍。\n鹧鸪声，蝴蝶梦，看夕阳多半，旧时台殿。\n花点红尘，绳牵紫燕，也应是、因缘一段。\n奈相思，千里月，任东风难教人排遣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5902,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浪淘沙  杨花","author":"李雯","text":"金缕晓风残，素雪晴翻。\n为谁飞上玉雕阑。\n可惜章台新雨后，踏入沙间。\n沾惹忒无端，青鸟空衔。\n一春幽梦绿萍闲。\n暗处消魂罗袖薄，与泪轻弹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5903,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦江南 湖上春早二首 其一","author":"宋琬","text":"郎有约，草草画双蛾。\n行到西陵松柏下，游人争似蜜蜂多。\n偷眼送春波。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5904,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦江南 湖上春早二首 其二","author":"宋琬","text":"妆阁外，一带绿杨烟。\n冶叶倡条今尽矣，春来那得到三眠。\n何处繫郎船。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5905,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆王孙 菊花有名二乔者一朵中紫白各半盖异种也","author":"宋琬","text":"前身曾喜嫁周郎。\n近托柴桑处士庄。\n姊妹争如斗草强。\n效鸳鸯。\n偷得徐娘半面妆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5906,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆王孙 闺怨四首 其一","author":"宋琬","text":"丝丝娇柳逐风斜。\n晓日瞳胧掩碧纱。\n强起还慵理鬓鸦。\n白杨花。\n犹自多情入妾家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5907,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆王孙 闺怨四首 其二","author":"宋琬","text":"越来溪上采莲舟。\n偷照蛾眉向浅流。\n女伴相呼怕举头。\n羡沙鸥。\n飞去飞来只自由。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5908,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆王孙 闺怨四首 其三","author":"宋琬","text":"儿家门对白蘋洲。\n夫婿经年事远游。\n杨柳青青古渡头。\n恨轻舟。\n不载郎归载妾愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5909,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆王孙 闺怨四首 其四","author":"宋琬","text":"空房胆怯梦多讹。\n长向花前敛翠蛾。\n幽恨诗成懒去歌。\n背吟哦。\n闷倚朱栏教八哥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5910,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如梦令 离情四首 其一","author":"宋琬","text":"刚到凤凰台上。\n无那骊驹三唱。\n愿作博山炉，魂逐沈烟游飏。\n罗帐。\n罗帐。\n高筑愁城千丈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5911,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如梦令 离情四首 其二","author":"宋琬","text":"织女黄姑月月。\n偏受天公磨折。\n正尔拜双星，蓦地燕南越北。\n新月。\n新月。\n乍缺乍圆似妾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5912,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如梦令 离情四首 其三","author":"宋琬","text":"小胆空房多悸。\n那更鸟啼蛩嚏。\n帘卷看银河，心与繁星俱碎。\n红泪。\n红泪。\n长浸合欢翠被。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5913,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如梦令 离情四首 其四","author":"宋琬","text":"别后云鬟慵整。\n蛛网鞶囊金镜。\n罗袜步空阶，几曲雕栏独凭。\n花影。\n花影。\n满地月明清冷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5914,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长相思 吴门夜泊","author":"宋琬","text":"大江东。\n五湖东。\n地主今无皋伯通。\n谁人许赁舂。\n听来鸿。\n送归鸿。\n夜雨霏霏舴艋中。\n寒山寺里钟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5915,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"生查子 春闺 俱戏用药名","author":"宋琬","text":"明日杏初红，新来黄白瘦。\n栀子几时回，验取丁香扣。\n兔丝蔓已长，枳壳花开又。\n结哽画双蛾，青黛眉儿皱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5916,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"生查子 夏闺","author":"宋琬","text":"二月算当归，于今将半夏。\n谁与醉菖蒲，芍药吹残也。\n啼鸟宿纱窗，清泪珍珠泻。\n红豆尽抛残，笑把林禽打。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5917,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"生查子 秋闺","author":"宋琬","text":"凉夜正悬参，贪看牵牛卧。\n欲睡复防风，故纸窗棂破。\n晓起郁金堂，篆里沈香盉。\n纤手泛茱萸，满地黄金涴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5918,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"生查子 冬闺","author":"宋琬","text":"人言欢欲来，续断庞儿吠。\n寒夜转相思，相思增五倍。\n侬似款冬花，心为檀郎翠。\n十斛买香醪，此夕因沉醉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5919,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇 刘峻度席上听女郎度曲","author":"宋琬","text":"子夜清歌，隔帘疑在青天外。\n琼箫玉管。\n莫把莺喉碍。\n纱帽笼头，卸却残妆戴。\n娇羞坏。\n广场无奈。\n初学男儿拜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5920,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇 简陆元见徵士","author":"宋琬","text":"牧竖樵儿，斧斤渐逼筼筜谷。\n梅花有福，逃入幽人屋。\n甫里先生，邀我供茶粥。\n频来熟。\n丹经同读。\n床下眠麋鹿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5921,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 其二 芳草","author":"宋琬","text":"乍暖犹寒二月天。\n玉楼长抱博山眠。\n沈香火冷少人添。\n残雪才消春鸟哢，画阑干外草芊绵。\n几时青得到郎边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5922,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卜算子 榆荚钱四首 其一","author":"宋琬","text":"良冶让天工，不怕铜山匮。\n铸就青蚨亿万缗，乱向枝头寄。\n鹅眼易飘零，贯朽还垂地。\n欲付新丰旧酒楼，少个开元字。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5923,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卜算子 榆荚钱四首 其二","author":"宋琬","text":"不见鼓洪炉，但见泉刀泻。\n袅袅垂杨欲聘梅，千万春风价。\n撒漫古城边，暴富田翁舍。\n斗草儿童扑满轮，一掷斜阳下。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5924,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卜算子 榆荚钱四首 其三","author":"宋琬","text":"宜向库中藏，却向林端挂。\n荡子东君不作家，散作莺花债。\n万选绕丛悬，赤仄连青霭。\n满地残英谁主人，贱把春光卖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192f